# Teapot Slinger: on turn three its controller spends three mana on Gray Ogre, which the opponent counters - mana spent
# on a spell counts toward expend whether or not it resolves (CR 700.14, the expend rulings). Lightning Bolt, off Lotus
# Petal, is the fourth mana: they expend 4 and the Slinger deals 2 damage to each opponent, before the Bolt's 3. On turn
# one, cast for four, it didn't see its own fourth mana.

